# rfc-003-course-assignment.mdc

## Title
RFC 003 – Course Creation & Assignment

## Summary
This RFC defines the creation, management, and assignment process of educational courses. Each course is a collection of ordered videos and can be marked as mandatory. Courses can be assigned to users by Admins or Team Leads.

---

## Goals
- Enable course creation from existing videos
- Allow structured course content with metadata
- Support assigning courses to users and teams
- Display progress bar based on video completion

## Database Tables
### `courses`
| Field         | Type      | Description                     |
|---------------|-----------|---------------------------------|
| id            | uuid      | Primary key                     |
| title         | text      | Course title                    |
| description   | text      | Course summary                  |
| is_mandatory  | boolean   | If course is required           |
| created_by    | uuid      | Creator user ID                 |
| created_at    | timestamp | Created time                    |

### `course_videos`
| Field       | Type    | Description                |
|-------------|---------|----------------------------|
| course_id   | uuid    | FK to courses              |
| video_id    | uuid    | FK to videos               |
| order       | int     | Order of appearance        |

### `course_assignments`
| Field       | Type    | Description              |
|-------------|---------|--------------------------|
| user_id     | uuid    | FK to profiles           |
| course_id   | uuid    | FK to courses            |
| assigned_at | timestamp | Timestamp               |

## Frontend UI
- Course Builder UI (multi-select video modal)
- Course Listing Page (title, duration, status)
- Course Detail Page (videos, metadata, progress bar)

## Role Permissions
- Admin: Full CRUD and assignment rights
- Team Lead: Create/edit/assign within team scope
- User: View assigned courses only

## Validation
- At least one video must be selected to create course
- Duplicate video entries in same course are disallowed

## Timeline
**Sprint 3**
- Setup course, course_videos, and course_assignments tables
- Implement course creation UI
- Enable assignment UI and dashboard integration

